-- Relic — 10 SEED ACCOUNTS (realistic names, e.g. "Ingrid Solberg") with public activities,
-- so a small beta has people to follow. Kept until there are enough real users.
-- Generated by a script; run in the Supabase SQL Editor. Safe to re-run.
-- Sign in as any of them: user1@example.com … user10@example.com
--                         password: relic-test-1234
-- Remove them all again: docs/dev/seed-test-users-cleanup.sql
-- Run AFTER supabase-social-v2.sql if you want the kudos/comments part.

-- User 1
